@prefix c: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/> .
@prefix v: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/> .

c:dpll-t v:solves c:satisfiability-modulo-theories .
c:dpll-t v:uses c:theory-solver .
c:dpll-t v:uses c:propositional-abstraction .
c:congruence-closure-decision-procedure v:solves c:ground-euf-satisfiability .
c:congruence-closure-decision-procedure v:uses c:equality-uninterpreted-functions .
c:congruence-closure-decision-procedure v:computes c:congruence-closure .
c:resolution-logic v:uses c:most-general-unifier .
c:critical-pair v:uses c:most-general-unifier .
c:rewriting-newman-lemma v:requiresPremise c:rewriting-termination .
c:rewriting-newman-lemma v:requiresPremise c:rewriting-local-confluence .
c:cut-elimination v:uses c:sequent-calculus .
c:cut-elimination v:uses c:cut-rule .
c:cut-rule v:uses c:sequent .
c:natural-deduction-normalization v:uses c:inference-rule .
c:natural-deduction-normalization v:uses c:intuitionistic-propositional-logic .
c:typing-judgment v:uses c:typing-context .
c:beta-reduction v:uses c:capture-avoiding-substitution .
c:simply-typed-lambda-calculus v:uses c:typing-context .
c:simply-typed-lambda-calculus v:uses c:beta-reduction .
c:simply-typed-lambda-calculus v:hasProperty c:stlc-type-safety .
c:stlc-type-safety v:uses c:type-preservation .
c:stlc-type-safety v:uses c:type-progress .
c:inductive-type v:uses c:inductive-eliminator .
c:dependent-function-type v:uses c:dependent-type .
c:dependent-pair-type v:uses c:dependent-type .
c:los-theorem v:uses c:ultraproduct .
c:elementary-embedding v:uses c:satisfaction-relation .
c:first-order-compactness-theorem v:uses c:first-order-logic .
c:sat-bounded-model-checking v:uses c:sat-solver .
c:smt-bounded-model-checking v:uses c:satisfiability-modulo-theories .
c:sat-solver v:solves c:boolean-satisfiability .
c:propositional-abstraction v:computes c:boolean-formula .
